<h3>About Murmur</h3>
<p>Murmur now has a proper About panel, reachable from the app menu, showing the version and who made it. The same credit sits at the foot of Settings → General, where the version number is now visible too — previously it only appeared if an update check happened to run.</p>
<p>Created with ❤️ by Prayas.</p>
